       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. That is twice the usual maximum for a prescription dose in adults (3,200 mg/day). The single 1600 mg dose is also twice the usual maximum of 800 mg per dose. At this level the risks of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up a lot, even in a patient with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the maximum dose for a prescription\n- **600 mg PO four times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **400 mg PO four times daily** (1,600 mg/day)\n- **1600 mg total per day**, divided into smaller doses\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and I'll enter it with a note recording that it's intentional. Otherwise, tell me the dose you want and I'll enter it right away."
